{
  "comment": "C0 census classes (TL-6), data not code (K15). platform: a metric name that starts with one of the prefixes (an entry ending in _ or :) or equals one of the names is emitted by a platform, exporter or agent, not by the subject's own code. series_suffixes and unit_suffixes are Prometheus' and the OpenTelemetry-to-Prometheus translation's (a histogram's _bucket/_count/_sum, a counter's _total, a unit's _seconds): an emitter literal is compared after they are stripped, and with . - / read as _.",
